  "tema": "juego",
  "secs": [
   [
    "Summary",
    "<ul>\n<li>1.0.1: four free extra weapons, one per type: <a href=\"#/objeto/IID_開かれし救世の剣\">Chosen Sword</a>, <a href=\"#/objeto/IID_氷の救世の槍\">Chosen Lance</a>, <a href=\"#/objeto/IID_ブレイザブリク\">Breidablik</a> and <a href=\"#/objeto/IID_王家の宝剣\">Royal Sword</a>. They are obtained on each route, but are not kept between routes.</li>\n<li>1.1.0: Expansion Pass support.</li>\n<li>Wave 1: a \"Prototype\" weapon per lord, inspired by Three Houses relics, with a quest on each route.</li>\n<li>Wave 2 (winter 2026): Aurora, Jurah and Smyrnos recruitable in Part 3<span class=\"gu-com\" title=\"Community fact\"><span class=\"sr-only\">(community fact)</span></span>.</li>\n<li>Wave 3 (2027): routes for Anatolia, Bertrand, Orchel and Talimun, with new allies and classes<span class=\"gu-com\" title=\"Community fact\"><span class=\"sr-only\">(community fact)</span></span>. The game already has their unlock conditions (Part 2 finished or skipped on certain routes, see <a href=\"#/guia/rutas\">Routes</a>), but in version 1.1.1 their texts are still empty.</li>\n</ul>"
   ],
   [
    "1.0.1 weapons",
    "<p>Part 1 gives the base versions. They do not carry over to the War, but Part 2 hands out their +1 versions and Part 3 the +2 ones.</p>"
   ],
   [
    "\"Prototype\" weapons (wave 1)",
    "<p>Each lord has a quest between chs. 4 and 12 of their Part 1 that gives their Prototype and <a href=\"#/objeto/IID_アガルチウム\">Agarthium</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"md\"><tr><th>Route</th><th>Quest</th><th>Weapon</th></tr><tr><td>Cai</td><td><a href=\"#/mision/SQID_リベイラの風の皆様へ\">To Cai, the Young Man of Rumor</a></td><td><a href=\"#/objeto/IID_試作品７号\">Prototype VII</a> (spear)</td></tr><tr><td>Dietrich</td><td><a href=\"#/mision/SQID_ラミーヌ一家の皆様へ\">To Dietrich, the Foreign Swordsman</a></td><td><a href=\"#/objeto/IID_試作品１号\">Prototype I</a> (sword)</td></tr><tr><td>Theodora</td><td><a href=\"#/mision/SQID_メガエラの灯火の皆様へ\">To Theodora, Queen of Saramis</a></td><td><a href=\"#/objeto/IID_試作品11号\">Prototype XI</a> (bow)</td></tr><tr><td>Leda</td><td><a href=\"#/mision/SQID_薔薇の嵐の皆様へ\">To Leda, the Famed Musician</a></td><td><a href=\"#/objeto/IID_試作品５号\">Prototype V</a> (axe)</td></tr></table></div>\n<p>In Part 3 you receive the Prototype of each route whose Part 2 has been completed. Details: <a href=\"#/dificultad?t=dlc\">Difficulty, DLC and patches</a>.</p>"
   ],
   [
    "How it works",
    "<p>No patch has changed the known tricks (support loop, double week, fixed sequence). The Pass is not sold by wave.</p>"
   ],
   [
    "Min-max tips",
    "<ul>\n<li>Pick up the extra weapons when starting each route: they help a lot in the first chapters.</li>\n<li>Do the Prototype quest on every route you play up to Part 2: that way it also reaches Part 3.</li>\n</ul>"
   ]
  ]
